# Runtime Boundary (always on — cheap, high-value guard)

Protected modules — do **not** modify unless the current mission explicitly requires it:

- Runtime
- Fleet
- Queue
- Browser (CDP lease/session)
- Scheduler
- Publisher Runtime

If a task touches any of the above, stop and confirm scope with the user before editing —
these are shared runtime primitives; a silent change can break scan/publish for every tenant.

This is the only rule loaded on every request. Everything else below is loaded on demand —
see `10-architecture-gate.mdc` and `20-product-context.mdc`.
